2. **Map the Access Control Policy** (Policies tab) — same policy backing the other CC 6.x controls.
3. **Map the existing passing automated tests** that evidence restricted access (SSO/IdP access managed, MFA enforced, unique accounts, role/least-privilege, offboarding access removal, production/server access restricted). Reuse the exact tests already mapped to sibling controls "Production deployment access restricted" / "Remote access MFA enforced".
